sequenceDiagram
    actor Customer
    participant O as Orders API and workflow
    participant DB as Orders database
    participant F as Fulfillment
    participant P as Payment Simulator
    participant I as Inventory
    participant K as CDC/Kafka/History
    Customer->>O: Cancel owned order with idempotency key
    O->>DB: Lock order, verify completed checkout and pre-handoff state
    DB->>DB: Persist fenced cancellation operation
    O->>F: Claim cancellation against expected shipment revision
    F->>F: Lock shipment row; reject if handoff already won
    O->>P: Refund captured total with deterministic operation ID
    O->>I: Restore committed reservation once under cancellation operation
    O->>F: Finalize claimed shipment as CANCELLED
    O->>DB: Mark order CANCELLED and append v2 event atomically
    DB-->>K: Debezium publishes committed cancellation fact
    O-->>Customer: Original operation receipt/state on retry
